{"4317790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Pirates: Die Together", "steam_appid": 4317790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/10fbdcad131e87ee912bad4601219599.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/a374e8c7840b8b53e0f6f5944faf7362.poster.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/a374e8c7840b8b53e0f6f5944faf7362.webm?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/a374e8c7840b8b53e0f6f5944faf7362.mp4?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Pirates: Die Together is an online co-op horror experience filled with chaos, monsters, and LOTS OF BOOTY! You and your crew will use your unusually stretchy arms to gather as much loot as you can for your captain. Be mindful of your surroundings though. There are others who mean to keep the treasure for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/de09d7aed1d16fd861ffa6c5d64a97b1.webp?t=1787834375\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You land lubbers aren’t that tough! You and up to three of your closest mates will work together, communicate, and survive as you try to make your ol’ captain rich and happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/7267abd3743573b0dafb920f5f0256a1.poster.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/7267abd3743573b0dafb920f5f0256a1.webm?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/7267abd3743573b0dafb920f5f0256a1.mp4?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/5f05e886d977b3d1aa27f7493f6f343b.webp?t=1787834375\" width=616 height=51 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are quite an unusual sailor! I bet you can grab just about anything with those pairs of hands. Dismantle doors, grab furniture, or destroy the island for all I care! Just bring that money back aboard or the captain will have our head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/9707bf939819a4123be458be7393e2c7.poster.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/9707bf939819a4123be458be7393e2c7.webm?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/9707bf939819a4123be458be7393e2c7.mp4?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/7653782376dbf9d6ac0728f3d767b7f5.webp?t=1787834375\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, scallywags, you are here for gold! Collect all the booties (and protect your own!), shake things down, and don’t come out empty-handed or no-legged. Feel the adventurous drive push you deeper into the mysterious island, but make sure that at least one of you lives to carry out the gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/f723e2f3195b6648980054f21b9b6ffd.poster.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/f723e2f3195b6648980054f21b9b6ffd.webm?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/f723e2f3195b6648980054f21b9b6ffd.mp4?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/937dec9acf6391518b1d9b712bf80517.webp?t=1787834375\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it back to the ship in one piece, would ya? Avoid all the dangers that the island has in store for you. Play the hero or hide somewhere if you find yourself in a pickle. Or maybe one of your crewmembers can provide a distraction… I’m sure they’ll be fine, trust us! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/c5bcc12b70af5cf19807f7a8f7a8db9c.poster.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/c5bcc12b70af5cf19807f7a8f7a8db9c.webm?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/c5bcc12b70af5cf19807f7a8f7a8db9c.mp4?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/3ca7bf179547186283b204474cf8bc87.webp?t=1787834375\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t be afraid to look at Davey Jones’ Locker. We all die anyway, so why not create an adventure worth remembering? Grab your crew, grab some booty, and make a story worth telling those bilge rats outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/05f4a6a3459389656c8e5006d4cd1c39.poster.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/05f4a6a3459389656c8e5006d4cd1c39.webm?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/05f4a6a3459389656c8e5006d4cd1c39.mp4?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/a374e8c7840b8b53e0f6f5944faf7362.poster.avif?t=1787834375\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/a374e8c7840b8b53e0f6f5944faf7362.webm?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317790/extras/a374e8c7840b8b53e0f6f5944faf7362.mp4?t=1787834375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span